        <div class="file-note"><strong>python/__PACKAGE_NAME_TEXT__/cgr_solver.py</strong><p>CVXPY custom solve method. It flattens updated parameters, calls the compiled PyO3 <code>solve(parameter_vector)</code> function, and unpacks results back through CVXPY.</p></div>
